  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Security and Justice Global Engagement - Component 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This component allows for DCAF to provide operational support that will both reinforce the international community&#x2019;s security and justice reform capability, and provide a programme scoping, design, monitoring and evaluation capability that will be made available to HMG. This is aimed only at benefitting ODA eligible countries.</narrative>
  </description>
